Airflow Core Components
Metadata DB: Information about data such as DAG execution details, task details etc. All historical and logs are stored. 
DAG Processor: It will scan,parse and read entire dags in dag folder and store all information into Metadata DB. 
API Server: It is a middleman to perform communication between all components in Airflow architecture. 

